            "review_title": "Review at Matte - Matcha Tea Bar",
            "review_text": "Bình Minh N\n2 contributions\n0\nPoor service\nJun 2026 • Friends\nExtremely disappointing experience.\n\nI waited over an hour without receiving my order, while many customers who came after me were served first. The café was clearly understaffed during peak hours, with only two employees trying to manage everything.\n\nWhen I asked to cancel my order and get a refund, the only response I received was an apology and a request for understanding.\n\nPoor service and poor customer handling. I won't be returning.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 25, 2026",
