            "review_title": "Review at Matte - Matcha Tea Bar",
            "review_text": "maryyeo\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4531 contributions\n0\nPretty location and good quality at the new District 7 outlet\nAug 2025 • Family\nHeard about this cool authentic Matcha tea house in District 3,\nExcited to see they have a new outlet at District 7, within Phu My Hung neighborhood.\n\nThe indoor air-conditioned area only had about four tables, but the indoor decor and bar top area was cool as they had customized sink area and dedicated matcha whisk station and tools. The authentic matcha fans will love witnessing the ceremonial grade matcha being hand-whisked with attention and care (note: it will take at least ten minutes to properly hand-whisk each order), thus increasing the appreciation of each cuppa. Only a few matcha desserts available but they looked instagrammable. Outdoor area had willowy trees and sculpted shade giving it a chill vibe.\nRead more\nWritten November 18, 2025",
